## Description
I want HTML to expand. So far it can just display and specify the structure like in JS. However, I would like to add a new feature. You should be able to regulate the following in HTML:

**@if**
```html
@if(data.username.startsWidth("Net")) {
<div><p>Hello World</p></div>
}
```

## Methoden
You should be able to use `@if` to check things that come from an object. Objects should be able to be hollowed out with a `<div data="[data, client]">`. You can then hollow out `data.name` or ...

